title: Home
---
body:

Hi! I'm Aditya, and I like building thoughtful, human-centered software at the point where data science meets everyday
life. I ship ML-backed products end to end—from experimentation and modeling through to the reliable systems that keep
experiences fast and delightful.

> From everyone who has been given much, much will be demanded; and from the one who has been entrusted with much, much
> more will be asked. _Luke 12:48_

Professionally, I've supported product, research, and platform teams across health tech and finance. My favorite work
happens alongside cross-functional partners who care about clear communication, rigorous thinking, and getting things
done. Away from screens I'm probably boxing, planning the next trip, or chasing the perfect espresso.

If you'd like to team up or just chat, feel free to reach out via [email](mailto:contact@pupscub.dev) or
[LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/in/aditya2312).

For the curious: this site is built with Lektor, Terminal.css, and a dash of custom CSS to keep the retro terminal vibe
alive.

### Open Source {#open-source}

- [Project One](https://github.com/) — replace with your featured open source highlights.
- [Project Two](https://github.com/) — describe the impact or learning.

### Collaborate {#manual}

I'm always excited to collaborate with teams who value clear thinking, deep empathy for users, and the craft of
shipping polished products. Drop a note and let's explore what we can build together.
